      "side": 1,
      "message": "These updated values are used to correctly put values in a byteBuffer in function \"encodeParams\", and parse them to produce a new instance with \"parseParams\". Before these values were updated, the encode and decode functions were causing index errors. After the fix, encode and parse works fine. I wrote how I found the problem and fixed these values in a reply to Hyundo\u0027s comment!",
